---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { eventConfig } from '../../../config/event.mjs';
import '../../../styles/admin.css';
import '../../../styles/contacts.css';
---
<SiteLayout title="名单与邀约｜ARTDiCO HOST" description="工作人员私有名单、活动安排与邀请函生成。">
  <div class="ah-admin contacts-app">
    <header class="ah-admin-header"><a class="ah-admin-brand" href="/">ARTDiCO <span>HOST / PEOPLE</span></a><nav class="contacts-nav"><a href="/admin/">场次与展位</a><a href="/">查看活动页面 ↗</a></nav></header>
    <main class="ah-admin-main" id="main-content">
      <div class="ah-admin-environment"><span class="ah-admin-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p><strong>本地私有工作区</strong>名单仅供有邀约权限的工作人员查看。导入、生成邀请函及记录发出均不会自动联系任何人。</p></div>
      <p data-contacts-status class="ah-admin-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p data-contacts-error class="ah-admin-alert" role="alert" hidden></p>
      <section data-contacts-login-panel class="ah-admin-login-card"><span class="ah-admin-eyebrow">PEOPLE & PLANNING</span><h1>名单与邀约管理</h1><p class="ah-admin-intro">使用具备「邀约管理」权限的工作人员账号登录。</p><form method="post" data-contacts-login><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contacts-user">用户名或邮箱</label><input id="contacts-user" name="username" autocomplete="username" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" required maxlength="160" placeholder="用户名或 @artdico.co 邮箱" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contacts-password">密码</label><input id="contacts-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="1024" /></div><button type="submit" class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" data-contacts-login-submit disabled>登录名单后台 →</button></form><noscript><p>启用 JavaScript 后才可登录和操作，不会直接提交账号资料。</p></noscript></section>
      <div class="contacts-account" data-contacts-account hidden><span data-contacts-user></span><button type="button" class="ah-admin-text-button" data-contacts-logout>退出登录</button></div>
      <section data-contacts-workspace hidden>
        <div class="ah-admin-page-heading"><div><span class="ah-admin-eyebrow">PEOPLE & PLANNING</span><h1>把名单，变成有进度的邀请。</h1><p>保留原报名意向，单独跟进邀约、回复和现场安排。</p></div><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-contacts-refresh>刷新名单</button></div>
        <div class="contacts-metrics" data-contacts-metrics></div><p class="contacts-planning-summary" data-contacts-planning></p>
        <section class="ah-admin-panel"><div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><span class="ah-admin-eyebrow">IMPORT</span><h2>导入报名名单</h2><p>先核对预览再入库。重复导入同一份问卷不会新增重复对象，也不会覆盖跟进备注。</p></div></div><div class="contacts-import"><label class="ah-admin-button contacts-file">选择 Excel 文件<input type="file" accept=".xlsx" data-contacts-file /></label><span data-contacts-file-name>支持本问卷的 Excel 导出格式</span><p class="ah-admin-small">支持序号版与文本版；选项已按文本逐笔核对。原意向与后续实际回复独立保存。</p><div data-import-preview hidden><p data-import-summary></p><div class="contacts-preview-rows" data-import-rows></div><label class="contacts-check"><input type="checkbox" data-import-duplicates />我已核对可能重复的联系方式，确认保留为独立对象</label><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" data-import-confirm disabled>确认导入</button><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-import-cancel>取消</button></div></div></section>
        <section class="ah-admin-panel"><div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><span class="ah-admin-eyebrow">FOLLOW UP</span><h2>对象名单</h2><p>身份和意向来自历史问卷，不代表资格、讲者、展位或出席已确认。</p></div><span data-contacts-result-count></span></div><div class="contacts-filters"><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contacts-search">搜索姓名、机构或城市</label><input type="search" id="contacts-search" data-contacts-search /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contacts-category">身份 / 参与方式</label><select id="contacts-category" data-contacts-category><option value="">全部</option></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contacts-response">出席回复</label><select id="contacts-response" data-contacts-response><option value="">全部</option><option value="pending">尚未确认</option><option value="attending">已确认出席</option><option value="declined">不出席</option></select></div><label class="contacts-check"><input type="checkbox" data-contacts-due />只看待跟进</label></div><div class="ah-admin-table-wrap"><table class="contacts-table"><caption class="ah-sr-only">私有报名对象和邀约跟进状态</caption><thead><tr><th>对象</th><th>身份与意向</th><th>邀请函 / 发出记录</th><th>跟进</th><th>出席回复</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody data-contacts-rows></tbody></table></div><p class="ah-admin-empty" data-contacts-empty>目前没有对象，请先导入并核对名单。</p></section>
        <section class="ah-admin-panel" data-invitation-panel hidden><div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><span class="ah-admin-eyebrow">A PERSONAL INVITATION</span><h2>邀请函生成器</h2><p>沿用提供的模板。生成图片不等于已经发出邀请，也不改变对方的出席回复。</p></div><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-invitation-close>关闭</button></div><div class="contacts-invitation-layout"><form data-invitation-form><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="invite-name">邀请函称呼</label><input id="invite-name" name="recipientName" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="off" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="invite-date">日期</label><input id="invite-date" name="date" type="date" value={eventConfig.date.value} required /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="invite-time">时间</label><input id="invite-time" name="time" value={eventConfig.time.label} required maxlength="80" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="invite-venue">地点</label><input id="invite-venue" name="venue" value={eventConfig.venue.address} required maxlength="160" /></div><label class="contacts-check"><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" />已核实本次活动日期、时间、地点，可输出正式邀请函</label><p class="ah-admin-small">日期、时间与场地已确认，楼层、入口及交通资讯另行公布。正式输出前请核对本次填写；未勾选时，图片保留「暂定」标示。</p><div class="contacts-action-row"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="submit" data-invitation-preview disabled>预览邀请函</button><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="button" data-invitation-download disabled>下载 PNG</button></div><hr /><p>已经通过微信或邮件亲自发出后，可在这里记录：</p><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="invite-channel">实际发出渠道</label><select id="invite-channel" data-invitation-channel><option value="wechat">微信</option><option value="email">邮件</option><option value="other">其他</option></select></div><label class="contacts-check"><input type="checkbox" data-invitation-sent-confirm />我已通过所选渠道实际发出邀请</label><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-invitation-record-sent disabled>记录已发出</button><p class="ah-admin-small">此按钮只保存工作人员的发出记录，不会发送消息。</p></form><div class="contacts-invitation-preview"><canvas width="1080" height="1920" data-invitation-canvas hidden></canvas><img data-invitation-image alt="个人邀请函 PNG 预览" hidden /><p data-invitation-caption>选择对象后点击预览，生成专属邀请函。预览图可右键或长按保存。</p></div></div><div class="contacts-communications"><div class="contacts-provider"><div class="contacts-provider-heading"><span class="ah-admin-eyebrow">APPLE WALLET</span><span class="contacts-setup-badge">尚未接入</span></div><h3>一张放进口袋的邀请</h3><p class="ah-admin-small" data-wallet-status>Apple Wallet 账号与签名凭证尚未配置，目前可查看未签名卡片预览。</p><div class="contacts-action-row"><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-wallet-preview-button disabled>预览 Wallet 卡片</button><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-wallet-add disabled>加入 Apple Wallet（待接入）</button></div><div class="contacts-wallet-card" data-wallet-preview hidden><p class="contacts-wallet-label">ARTDiCO HOST · 未签名预览</p><h4 data-wallet-title></h4><p class="contacts-wallet-name" data-wallet-name></p><div class="contacts-wallet-schedule"><p><span>日期</span><strong data-wallet-date></strong></p><p><span>时间</span><strong data-wallet-time></strong></p></div><p class="contacts-wallet-location" data-wallet-location></p><p class="contacts-wallet-notice" data-wallet-notice></p></div><p class="ah-admin-small">预览不会生成可导入的通行证，不含入场二维码，也不记录发出。</p></div><div class="contacts-provider"><div class="contacts-provider-heading"><span class="ah-admin-eyebrow">EMAILJS</span><span class="contacts-setup-badge">尚未接入</span></div><h3>出席确认信</h3><p class="ah-admin-small" data-email-status>EmailJS 服务与邮件模板尚未配置，目前仅提供确认信预览。</p><p class="ah-admin-small" data-email-eligibility>请先核实对方回复，并保存「已确认出席」，才可预览确认信。</p><div class="contacts-action-row"><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-email-preview-button disabled>预览确认信</button><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-email-send disabled>发送确认信（待接入）</button></div><div class="contacts-email-preview" data-email-preview hidden><dl><dt>收件人</dt><dd data-email-to></dd><dt>主题</dt><dd data-email-subject></dd></dl><pre data-email-text></pre><p class="ah-admin-small">内容预览 · 尚未发送</p></div></div></div></section>
      </section>
    </main><footer class="ah-admin-footer"><span>ARTDiCO HOST / PEOPLE</span><p>名单只用于本次活动筹备与跟进。</p><a href="/admin/">返回场次与展位后台</a></footer>
  </div>
  <dialog class="ah-admin-dialog contacts-dialog" data-contact-dialog aria-labelledby="contact-dialog-title"><div class="ah-admin-dialog-heading"><div><span class="ah-admin-eyebrow">CONTACT & PLAN</span><h2 id="contact-dialog-title" data-contact-title>对象详情</h2></div><button type="button" class="ah-admin-icon-button" data-contact-close aria-label="关闭对象详情">×</button></div><div class="contacts-source" data-contact-profile></div><p class="ah-admin-small">以上保留历史报名原意。下方为工作人员跟进记录，两者独立保存。</p><p class="ah-admin-alert" data-contact-error role="alert" hidden></p><form method="post" data-contact-form><fieldset data-contact-fields><div class="ah-admin-field-row ah-admin-two-columns"><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contact-owner">跟进同事</label><input id="contact-owner" name="owner" maxlength="120" placeholder="填写负责同事姓名" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contact-priority">跟进优先级</label><select id="contact-priority" name="priority"><option value="normal">普通</option><option value="high">优先跟进</option></select></div></div><div class="ah-admin-field-row ah-admin-two-columns"><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contact-followup">下次跟进日期</label><input id="contact-followup" name="followUpAt" type="date" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contact-reply">对方最新出席回复</label><select id="contact-reply" name="responseStatus"><option value="pending">尚未确认</option><option value="attending">已确认出席</option><option value="declined">不出席</option></select></div></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="contact-notes">内部跟进备注</label><textarea id="contact-notes" name="notes" rows="3" maxlength="4000"></textarea></div><details><summary>安排参与场次</summary><p class="ah-admin-small">仅用于内部协调，不会自动把对象公开为讲者。重叠场次不能同时安排给同一人。</p><div class="contacts-assignments" data-contact-sessions></div></details><details><summary>安排出席展位</summary><p class="ah-admin-small">意向不等于已经获得展位。这里只关联已经建立的展位记录，不公开私人联系方式。</p><div class="contacts-assignments" data-contact-booths></div></details><div class="ah-admin-dialog-actions"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-contact-close>取消</button><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="submit" data-contact-save disabled>保存跟进与安排</button></div></fieldset></form></dialog>
  <script>
    import '../../../scripts/contacts.mjs';
  </script>
</SiteLayout>
